  "question": {
    "text": "A ball is thrown from the ground to clear a wall <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> high at a distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and falls <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> away from the wall, the angle of projection of ball is",
